@document
  title: Nested Columns Example

@center
  # Nested Columns Demo

This document demonstrates top-level columns (using Section Breaks) and nested columns (using Tables).

@columns 2 gap=0in separator
  @center
    ## Left Column (Top Level)

    This text is in the left column. It uses a native Word section break.

    @box
      **Nested Layout inside Box**

      @columns 2 gap=0.1in
        @center
          Left inner.
        @end
        @break
        @center
          Right inner.
        @end
      @end

      (Box continues...)
    @end
  @end

  @break

  @center
    ## Right Column (Top Level)

    This text is in the right column.

    @columns 3
      @center
        1. One
      @end
      @break
      @center
        2. Two
      @end
      @break
      @center
        3. Three
      @end
    @end
  @end
@end

Back to single column.

